ps://x.com/plpam23187146/status/2120375492889207262"}, {"author_id": "1618397562897154048", "created_at": "2026-11-11T04:53:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120379487573450902"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5TQe1dB_CB…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5TQe1dB_CB5PYaa-yClD2AA1?pwd=girk", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5TQe1dB_CB5PYaa-yClD2AA1?pwd=girk", "url": "https://t.co/xYsFuPOAw1"}]}, "id": "2120379487573450902", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 28206, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/xYsFuPOAw1\n\n【完结】《［穿书］小师弟只想咸鱼》作者：桑同学【N】\n【完结】《心魔引》作者：QJF【N】\n【完结】《夫死心累》作者：lynn海【N】\n【完结】《万人嫌师弟失踪了》作者：新界乞丐【N】\n【完结】《万人嫌fw被杀7证道了》作者：贺锦霄【N】", "url": "https://x.com/yurme74286573/status/2120379487573450902"}, {"author_id": "1908125905144401920", "created_at": "2026-11-11T08:24:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120432349825712260"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/th2uf96XHx", "end": 62, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/option_king1/status/2120432349825712260/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120432143331639296", "start": 39, "url": "https://t.co/th2uf96XHx"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Paris13Jeanne/…", "end": 86, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Paris13Jeanne/status/2120247144951185708", "start": 63, "url": "https://t.co/PD3FfohbYr"}]}, "id": "2120432349825712260", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 312, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120247144951185708", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "就剩我还在研究修改缠论吗?啊啊啊啊，AI好强大烧脑的缠论交给DeepSeek https://t.co/th2uf96XHx https://t.co/PD3FfohbYr", "url": "https://x.com/option_king1/status/2120432349825712260"}, {"author_id": "2119970696009007104", "created_at": "2026-11-11T02:28:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120342820519330149"], "id": "2120342820519330149", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论非常适合用来构建一套 XAUUSD多周期结构交易系统。\n但我认为，交易黄金不能只是看到一买就做多、看到三卖就做空。黄金波动大、趋势性强，而且经常出现快速扫损、假突破和数据公布时的剧烈跳动。\n真正实用的思路是：\n用大级别缠论判断方向，用小级别缠论寻找入场点，用严格的风险管理控制亏损。", "url": "https://x.com/ectradewinner/status/2120342820519330149"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:16:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120445453833839097"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/D7z7Ntd5Bv", "end": 100, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2120445453833839097/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120445405460856832", "start": 77, "url": "https://t.co/D7z7Ntd5Bv"}]}, "id": "2120445453833839097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今晚19:00全网缠论公开直播课\n专注币圈/股票/黄金/原油实战操作\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n直播地址：币安广场关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/D7z7Ntd5Bv", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2120445453833839097"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:34:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120525616575639683"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PqxocueGtO", "end": 140, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2120525616575639683/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120525586842136576", "start": 117, "url": "https://t.co/PqxocueGtO"}]}, "id": "2120525616575639683", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "行，就是修行，“见、闻、学、行”，缺一不可。缠论体系如同大道，不需要私藏着，大家都可以学、都可以行，但能否行到不退转的位置，是否最终还是“学如不及，犹恐失之”，那就要靠每个人自身的修行了。11月操盘手训练营缠论进阶实战课报名已开启~ https://t.co/PqxocueGtO", "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2120525616575639683"}, {"author_id": "2119970696009007104", "created_at": "2026-11-11T02:57:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120350267711578224"], "id": "2120350267711578224", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论again。MP Materials （MP）也可以买入了，一旦起来行情会很大。", "url": "https://x.com/ectradewinner/status/2120350267711578224"}, {"author_id": "2041381678883414016", "created_at": "2026-11-11T07:00:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120411317207232524"], "id": "2120411317207232524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论、龙头战法、情绪周期——这些以前只在老师傅脑子里的方法论，现在能直接喊 AI 来跑了。\n一个开源插件，把 71 个金融工具和 21 个 AI Skills 打包成了一套投研流水线。🧵\n\n先说它治的是什么病：以前让 AI", "url": "https://x.com/onchicelle/status/2120411317207232524"}, {"author_id": "2021396808497606656", "created_at": "2026-11-11T09:18:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120446010480800084"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KuSiw7aBZw", "end": 50, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/XuJin_XuJames/status/2120446010480800084/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120445228268306432", "start": 27, "url": "https://t.co/KuSiw7aBZw"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/KuSiw7aBZw", "end": 50, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/XuJin_XuJames/status/2120446010480800084/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120445372678217728", "start": 27, "url": "https://t.co/KuSiw7aBZw"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/KuSiw7aBZw", "end": 50, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/XuJin_XuJames/status/2120446010480800084/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120445417569812481", "start": 27, "url": "https://t.co/KuSiw7aBZw"}]}, "id": "2120446010480800084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NVDA英伟达-走势图形结构\n使用缠论进行走势分析。 https://t.co/KuSiw7aBZw", "url": "https://x.com/XuJin_XuJames/status/2120446010480800084"}, {"author_id": "1891330878393167872", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:03:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120140222122033428"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kmEtpeVVkB", "end": 138, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SoulSloop99/status/2120140222122033428/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120140215117615104", "start": 115, "url": "https://t.co/kmEtpeVVkB"}]}, "id": "2120140222122033428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1380, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一定要诵这部经，比跪拜一万次还厉害，让你从此不同！\n\n今天，分享一部被现在无数修行人奉为“求财第一经”的宝典——《大乘离文字普光明藏经》。\n\n古人因此有各种财富记载，现代人也有把此经与巨财联系的记录。所以，佛门内外当下十分流行。 https://t.co/kmEtpeVVkB", "url": "https://x.com/SoulSloop99/status/2120140222122033428"}, {"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-11-11T02:52:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120348915690361291"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 54, "start": 50, "tag": "BTC"}, {"end": 59, "start": 55, "tag": "ETH"}, {"end": 65, "start": 61, "tag": "WTi"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wcCCfRGxPF", "end": 89, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2120348915690361291/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120348427154497536", "start": 66, "url": "https://t.co/wcCCfRGxPF"}]}, "id": "2120348915690361291", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 41, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "原油又受到世界格局的影响，现在波动也是很大，最新的缠论技术分析，给出详细的解答，欢迎大家来讨论！\n\n#BTC　#ETH  #WTi https://t.co/wcCCfRGxPF", "url": "https://x.com/maoyao6688/status/2120348915690361291"}, {"author_id": "1971122505713876992", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:36:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120480774201987210"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/tlTS0vBdFB", "end": 112, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/fanxing001_btc/status/2120480774201987210/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120480766039826435", "start": 89, "url": "https://t.co/tlTS0vBdFB"}]}, "id": "2120480774201987210", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 302, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论，对新手来说，最难的还是放弃左侧抄底、摸顶的1买/1卖\n\n我们还是要多做 2 买/2 卖和 3 买/3卖\n\n我个人觉得最难的还是人性，冒进，嘴硬，并且不愿意承认自己做错了😂 https://t.co/tlTS0vBdFB", "url": "https://x.com/fanxing001_btc/status/2120480774201987210"}, {"author_id": "1748602031248732160", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:58:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120320165858689137"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LhrlCFRPQL", "end": 178, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2120320165858689137/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120318188273700864", "start": 155, "url": "https://t.co/LhrlCFRPQL"}, {"display_url": "x.com/_zheergen/stat…", "end": 202, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/_zheergen/status/2120165685800419758", "start": 179, "url": "https://t.co/kAsDsXY14C"}]}, "id": "2120320165858689137", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 151, "impression_count": 19689, "like_count": 130, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 25}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120165685800419758", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "有意思！现在连缠论、龙头战法、情绪周期，都能直接让 AI 帮你分析了？\n\n71 个金融工具 + 21 个 AI Skills，从全市场选股、资金流分析到策略回测，直接整合成一套！\n\n开源项目 Stock Analysis Plugin，覆盖 A 股、港股、美股、日股、韩股、台股 6 大市场。\n\n以前用 AI https://t.co/LhrlCFRPQL https://t.co/kAsDsXY14C", "url": "https://x.com/_zheergen/status/2120320165858689137"}, {"author_id": "753864972589862912", "created_at": "2026-11-11T14:34:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120525456525111392"], "id": "2120525456525111392", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "交易系统有两大类：\n\n一类是看图表结构，归纳哪些特征的K线走势结构有更大的概率优势，然后长期做这类结构的交易机会；以价格行为、缠论为代表。", "url": "https://x.com/barryzhang999/status/2120525456525111392"}, {"author_id": "2112084592153026560", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:04:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120533225890300015"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 26, "start": 23, "tag": "黄金"}, {"end": 31, "start": 27, "tag": 